  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Chocolate Horse.png|200px|left|Chocolate Horse]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |Chocolate bunny = 30\n |level = 45\n |time = 10m\n |source = {{Infoicon|eastereggmaker2024|bigger|link=Easter Egg Maker}}\n |xp = 67\n |dia = 3\n |time3 = 8m\n}}\n'''Chocolate Horse''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 45. It's a special item used only for the Easterevent.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making Chocolate Horse'''===\n[[File:Easter Egg Maker 2025.png|150px|left|Easter Egg Maker 2025|link=Easter Egg Maker]]\nChocolate horses are made in the [[Easter Egg Maker]].\n\nTo make a chocolate horse, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Chocolate Cake.png|75px|Chocolate Cake|link=Chocolate Cake]]\n|[[File:Coffee Bean.png|75px|Coffee Bean|link=Coffee Bean]]\n|[[File:Chamomile.png|75px|Chamomile|link=Chamomile]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x5'''\n|}\nIt takes 10 minutes to make a chocolate horse. Each chocolate cow gives players 67 [[experience]] points.\n\n'''In 2026''', players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Chocolate Cake.png|75px|Chocolate Cake|link=Chocolate Cake]]\n|[[File:Coffee Bean.png|75px|Coffee Bean|link=Coffee Bean]]\n|[[File:Chamomile.png|75px|Chamomile|link=Chamomile]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x5'''\n|}\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 2 chocolate cows per crate, up to a total of 6 per boat. Each chocolate cow used on a boat will be rewarded with 30 [[Chocolate Bunny]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n[[Category:Easter Egg Maker Products]]\n[[Category:Chocolate Cake Products]]\n[[Category:Coffee Bean Products]]\n[[Category:Chamomile Products]]\n\n{{Languages\n|es = Caballo de chocolate 2025\n}}",
